# Scanning: the « Numérisation » app (shell/renderer/apps/scan) and the Scanners part of Paramètres > Imprimantes et
# scanners, through shell/main/ipc/scan.js, which runs `scanimage` as the signed-in user (never root).
# sane-utils: scanimage (sane-utils 1.2.1). It pulls libsane1 (the SANE backends for USB scanners: genesys, pixma,
# epson2, epsonds, plustek, fujitsu…), whose udev hwdb (20-sane.hwdb, libsane_matched=yes) is turned into an ACL for
# the user of the active session by systemd's 70-uaccess.rules: no « scanner » group, no root.
sane-utils
# sane-airscan: driverless network scanners (eSCL / AirScan and WSD), the scanning side of IPP Everywhere, and USB
# multifunction devices shared on localhost by ipp-usb (already in printing.list). libsane1 recommends it.
sane-airscan
